<i>Let's all sing together, gegege no ge</i>

00:01:50.360 --> 00:01:54.320
<i>minnade utaou gegege no ge</i>

00:01:54.440 --> 00:01:58.280
<i>Let's all sing together, gegege no ge</i>

00:01:54.440 --> 00:01:58.280
<i>minnade utaou gegege no ge</i>

00:01:58.780 --> 00:02:03.240
<i>Let's all sing together, gegege no ge</i>

00:01:58.780 --> 00:02:03.240
<i>minnade utaou gegege no ge</i>

00:02:39.360 --> 00:02:40.360
CHAPTER 38

00:02:40.910 --> 00:02:45.240
NEW YEAR'S MAN-EATING FABLE
KASHA

00:02:45.370 --> 00:02:47.750
WISHING TO PASS MY ENTRANCE EXAM

00:02:50.830 --> 00:02:55.300
<i>May it be a world where humans</i>
<i>and </i>yokai<i> can live together in harmony.</i>

00:02:56.130 --> 00:02:58.510
What did you pray for, Mana?

00:02:56.130 --> 00:02:58.510
FORTUNES

00:02:58.630 --> 00:03:00.050
It's a secret.

00:03:00.180 --> 00:03:01.390
Yes! Best Luck!

00:03:01.510 --> 00:03:03.260
I got Best Luck, too!

00:03:03.390 --> 00:03:04.930
Oh! Me too!

00:03:05.060 --> 00:03:09.230
I bet shrines only put Best Luck
in the fortune boxes at New Year's.

00:03:24.950 --> 00:03:27.910
Damn this is heavy.

00:03:34.920 --> 00:03:36.420
Heave ho...

00:03:40.300 --> 00:03:41.470
What?

00:03:47.760 --> 00:03:50.310
So, did you see the suspect's face?

00:03:50.430 --> 00:03:53.850
Yes, but it probably
wasn't a human but a <i>yok</i>...

00:03:53.980 --> 00:03:55.150
-Huh?!
-Er...!

00:03:55.270 --> 00:04:00.400
Uh... <i>Yoka...n</i> is my favorite snack.
I love sweet stuff.

00:04:00.530 --> 00:04:02.320
-Huh?
-I've got it.

00:04:03.030 --> 00:04:05.450
A nearby hospital sent in a report.

00:04:05.570 --> 00:04:08.370
It looks like the body was
stolen from there.

00:04:08.490 --> 00:04:13.620
Hmm. What did the suspect intend to do
by stealing a corpse?

00:04:15.750 --> 00:04:18.630
That was probably the Kasha's doing.

00:04:18.750 --> 00:04:19.920
The Kasha?

00:04:20.050 --> 00:04:22.380
"Kasha" uses the characters for
"fire" and "handcart."

00:04:20.050 --> 00:04:22.380
KASHA

00:04:22.510 --> 00:04:24.640
Why does he steal dead bodies?

00:04:24.760 --> 00:04:28.850
He eats them.
He loves to eat corpses and mochi.

00:04:29.260 --> 00:04:30.890
He e-eats them?!

00:04:31.560 --> 00:04:34.440
Kasha is a <i>yokai</i> that has
existed since long ago.

00:04:34.560 --> 00:04:40.190
He used to steal bodies from funerals
and crematories, causing havoc.

00:04:44.860 --> 00:04:46.740
Give Mommy back!

00:04:49.870 --> 00:04:51.580
Havoc?

00:04:51.830 --> 00:04:55.460
But what I saw was a haggard old <i>yokai</i>.

00:04:55.580 --> 00:04:58.420
He couldn't carry the corpse
and was dragging it.

00:04:59.800 --> 00:05:04.170
I haven't heard about
the Kasha appearing recently.

00:05:04.300 --> 00:05:09.760
Maybe he's gotten old and weak in the legs
and can't carry corpses anymore.

00:05:10.890 --> 00:05:13.600
I smell an opportunity.

00:05:19.360 --> 00:05:23.110
I'm tired of eating mochi all the time.

00:05:23.690 --> 00:05:26.740
I want to eat a human corpse.

00:05:26.860 --> 00:05:29.370
Yo, are you Kasha?

00:05:30.240 --> 00:05:31.700
Who are you?

00:05:31.830 --> 00:05:34.040
I'm BiBiBi no Rat Man.

00:05:34.160 --> 00:05:36.870
I hear you failed to steal a dead body.

00:05:37.000 --> 00:05:40.250
Yes. Someone saw me dragging it.

00:05:40.380 --> 00:05:44.090
In the old days I could leap from
rooftop to rooftop.

00:05:44.210 --> 00:05:47.470
But now I'm old and just look at me.

00:05:47.590 --> 00:05:49.220
I've got a proposition.

00:05:49.340 --> 00:05:50.140
What?

00:05:50.720 --> 00:05:52.640
Wanna team up with me?

00:05:53.560 --> 00:05:54.640
Huh?

00:05:56.770 --> 00:06:03.150
THE BATTERIES YURIKO ALKALINE
2ND PHOTOBOOK BY POPULAR DEMAND

00:05:58.270 --> 00:06:00.150
Ain't this a pretty girl.

00:06:00.270 --> 00:06:03.150
Rub, rub, rub... Hm?

00:06:04.280 --> 00:06:07.860
-Oh you Rat-chan.
-That's... Rat Man?!

00:06:07.990 --> 00:06:11.870
What's he doin' with
a pretty young girl like that?

00:06:13.410 --> 00:06:14.830
Here, here.

00:06:17.290 --> 00:06:19.500
Thank you!

00:06:22.130 --> 00:06:24.090
That lucky guy.

00:06:24.210 --> 00:06:26.510
How'd he get all that money?

00:06:27.970 --> 00:06:30.010
Whoops. That's a work call.

00:06:30.140 --> 00:06:31.010
See you later.

00:06:31.140 --> 00:06:32.010
Okay.

00:06:32.720 --> 00:06:35.770
Yes, yes. Hello, this is BiBiBi Co.

00:06:36.100 --> 00:06:37.640
Let's see...

00:06:38.810 --> 00:06:40.270
Ah, this is the place.

00:06:41.480 --> 00:06:44.230
So, where's the thing
you wanna get rid of?

00:06:46.440 --> 00:06:48.030
She's in the back room.

00:06:48.320 --> 00:06:50.780
It's my mother.

00:06:50.910 --> 00:06:53.280
What, did you bump her off?

00:06:53.700 --> 00:06:54.910
Of course not.

00:06:55.040 --> 00:07:00.540
She's been bedridden for a while now,
and this morning she was dead.

00:07:00.670 --> 00:07:02.790
And you're not having a funeral?

00:07:03.420 --> 00:07:08.840
I'd like to avoid a notice of death
and funeral to pretend she's still alive.

00:07:09.130 --> 00:07:14.050
That way I can continue to collect
her pension.

00:07:14.510 --> 00:07:16.180
I see.

00:07:16.310 --> 00:07:21.850
You're ignoring all your mother's done to
raise you and wanna dispose of her body.

00:07:22.980 --> 00:07:25.480
What is this world coming to.

00:07:28.860 --> 00:07:31.570
But, I like what this world is coming to.

00:07:31.700 --> 00:07:32.450
Huh? Then...

00:07:32.570 --> 00:07:34.580
It'll cost five months pension.

00:07:34.700 --> 00:07:37.540
Or rather it would,
but I'm not a monster.

00:07:37.660 --> 00:07:40.330
I'll cut you a deal for only three months.

00:07:40.460 --> 00:07:42.830
Thank you so much. I'll get it right now.

00:07:45.960 --> 00:07:48.090
Rat Man.

00:07:48.210 --> 00:07:49.210
Sliiiip.

00:07:49.340 --> 00:07:50.920
R-R-Rollo Cloth!

00:07:51.050 --> 00:07:53.010
What the hell are ya doin'?

00:07:53.140 --> 00:07:55.680
You heard everything already, didn't you?

00:07:55.800 --> 00:07:58.220
What are ya doin' with the body?

00:07:59.180 --> 00:08:01.730
I'm feeding it to the feeble old Kasha.

00:08:01.850 --> 00:08:04.310
I'm just acting as a mediator.

00:08:04.440 --> 00:08:09.280
The hungry Kasha gets to eat a corpse,
I get lots of money...

00:08:09.400 --> 00:08:12.320
It's a three-way gain. Win-win-win.

00:08:12.450 --> 00:08:13.860
Everybody's happy.

00:08:14.240 --> 00:08:17.620
What's a <i>yokai</i> doin' gettin' involved
with human crimes?

00:08:17.740 --> 00:08:20.540
-I'm tellin' Kitaro...
-I'll introduce you to a cute girl.

00:08:20.660 --> 00:08:24.290
Wh-Wh-What are ya talkin' about?!
I-I ain't about to be bribed!

00:08:24.420 --> 00:08:26.420
She's a cute 20-year-old girl.

00:08:26.540 --> 00:08:29.210
I ain't lettin' ya talk me into it!

00:08:29.340 --> 00:08:34.260
But just for reference,
what famous person does that girl look--

00:08:34.380 --> 00:08:35.340
What are ya doin'?!

00:08:35.470 --> 00:08:36.850
What is this thing?

00:08:36.970 --> 00:08:38.760
Nice. Hold him right there.

00:08:38.890 --> 00:08:42.020
H-Hey whoa, whoa, whoa! Whoa, hey!
What, what are...

00:08:42.140 --> 00:08:43.980
Wh-... How cruel!

00:08:44.100 --> 00:08:47.650
He'll regenerate if we let him get wet.

00:08:48.070 --> 00:08:49.860
Oh, another job request.

00:08:49.980 --> 00:08:53.280
Later. Hold on and I'll drop by
to pick up the body.

00:08:53.400 --> 00:08:54.400
Okay.

00:08:54.530 --> 00:08:58.030
What? You got drunk and killed someone
with your car?

00:08:58.160 --> 00:09:02.910
P-Please! If nobody finds the body,
then I can sweep this under the rug!

00:09:03.040 --> 00:09:04.540
<i>Oh very well.</i>

00:09:04.670 --> 00:09:07.920
But it'll be expensive, Mr. President.

00:09:08.250 --> 00:09:10.460
What? A marital spat?

00:09:10.710 --> 00:09:12.760
You hit your husband and killed him?

00:09:13.130 --> 00:09:14.590
A girl you killed?

00:09:14.720 --> 00:09:17.590
You want to keep a finger
and get rid of the rest?

00:09:17.720 --> 00:09:19.970
Man, you're a real basket case.

00:09:20.100 --> 00:09:23.980
Ah, well, well. It's always a pleasure,
mister boss.

00:09:24.100 --> 00:09:26.400
How many should I dispose of today?

00:09:26.520 --> 00:09:28.900
BIBIBI CO.

00:09:29.980 --> 00:09:31.820
I'm stuffed.

00:09:35.360 --> 00:09:37.360
I've brought more bodies.

00:09:37.490 --> 00:09:42.290
Again? I may like eating them,
but I can't eat that many at once.

00:09:42.410 --> 00:09:44.160
I'm full for today.

00:09:44.290 --> 00:09:45.620
Don't blame me.

00:09:45.750 --> 00:09:51.300
People keep calling me asking to
take care of corpses.

00:09:51.420 --> 00:09:52.170
Eat up!

00:09:53.630 --> 00:09:56.300
I said I can't eat any more today.

00:09:56.430 --> 00:10:00.720
Besides, the bodies you bring
lack a certain flavor.

00:10:00.850 --> 00:10:02.600
They need more spice.

00:10:02.720 --> 00:10:03.350
Spice?

00:10:03.470 --> 00:10:07.020
That's right. The grief of the family
a body is stolen from.

00:10:07.140 --> 00:10:11.570
That becomes the perfect spice
to bring out the flavor of a corpse.

00:10:11.690 --> 00:10:13.570
Give Mommy back!

00:10:16.320 --> 00:10:18.950
The bodies you bring don't have that.

00:10:19.070 --> 00:10:22.200
Stop being picky, you feeble old <i>yokai</i>!

00:10:22.330 --> 00:10:25.950
True, this body has grown weary.

00:10:26.080 --> 00:10:28.210
So I was thinking...

00:10:28.330 --> 00:10:29.960
Wh-What?

00:10:30.080 --> 00:10:34.090
I've grown fond of this body,
but you can't beat age.

00:10:43.260 --> 00:10:45.350
Huh?! I'm in front of myself?

00:10:45.470 --> 00:10:47.640
Wh-Wh-What's going on here?!

00:10:48.770 --> 00:10:51.060
I've switched our bodies.

00:10:51.190 --> 00:10:56.030
All the corpses you've fed me has
restored my <i>yokai</i> power.

00:10:56.150 --> 00:10:58.820
Now, if you'll excuse me. It's been a gas.

00:11:01.200 --> 00:11:03.330
Pee-ew!

00:11:07.000 --> 00:11:08.460
Bye.

00:11:10.250 --> 00:11:12.460
HAPPY NEW YEAR

00:11:13.290 --> 00:11:16.960
KASHA

00:11:15.090 --> 00:11:15.960
-<i>"Bottom's up!"</i>
-<i>"Cheers!!"</i>

00:11:16.090 --> 00:11:16.960
<i>"You're out!!"</i>

00:11:19.380 --> 00:11:24.720
Man, I went to the trouble of stealing
this body, but it's already pretty cruddy.

00:11:25.810 --> 00:11:27.520
Plus it smells.

00:11:27.640 --> 00:11:28.560
And itches!

00:11:28.680 --> 00:11:31.940
I don't want to live in this body forever.

00:11:32.350 --> 00:11:35.020
I need to find a better one.

00:11:35.610 --> 00:11:39.570
Rat Man, what are you doing here?

00:11:40.030 --> 00:11:43.660
Not like I really care or anything.

00:11:44.030 --> 00:11:46.240
I-I'm not doing anything.

00:11:49.370 --> 00:11:52.290
There's something different about you.

00:11:52.420 --> 00:11:57.380
What do you mean? I'm the same
BiBiBi no Rat Man-sama as always.

00:11:57.500 --> 00:12:02.180
I'm not sure. I don't feel the urge
to hunt you like I usually do.

00:12:02.300 --> 00:12:04.720
You're scaring me with that
"urge to hunt" thing.

00:12:05.010 --> 00:12:09.140
But, that animal instinct
is pretty impressive. Good job.

00:12:10.350 --> 00:12:11.230
Wh-...

00:12:15.610 --> 00:12:17.480
What is this?! No!

00:12:17.610 --> 00:12:19.360
No! I-It itches!

00:12:20.190 --> 00:12:22.150
It smells! It itches!

00:12:22.400 --> 00:12:23.110
It smells!

00:12:24.530 --> 00:12:26.330
Eww! It smells!

00:12:32.250 --> 00:12:34.170
It's so light!

00:12:35.960 --> 00:12:38.920
This seems to have impressive
fighting power, too.

00:12:39.800 --> 00:12:44.130
This body is easy to move in,
it's graceful, and wonderful.

00:12:44.970 --> 00:12:50.850
Hmm. But these chilly legs are
a bit of a problem.

00:12:50.970 --> 00:12:54.480
I suppose I prefer a male body after all.

00:12:54.940 --> 00:12:56.230
Ah, I know.

00:12:56.900 --> 00:13:00.320
I'm borrowing the shower!
I-Itchy, itchy, itchy, itchy...!

00:13:04.360 --> 00:13:05.820
Ahh, bliss.

00:13:08.620 --> 00:13:10.790
I'm back!

00:13:14.830 --> 00:13:17.750
Hey! Don't look! Don't look, you pervert!

00:13:17.880 --> 00:13:20.380
Forget that pervert stuff. We got trouble.

00:13:20.500 --> 00:13:25.300
I know! I'm stuck in Rat Man's body here!
What is this?!

00:13:26.010 --> 00:13:27.760
Kitaro.

00:13:28.300 --> 00:13:29.600
Are you in?

00:13:30.890 --> 00:13:33.100
What's wrong, Catchick?

00:13:34.890 --> 00:13:38.190
It's nothing really.

00:13:39.360 --> 00:13:43.280
I just suddenly
felt like seeing you, Kitaro.

00:13:43.610 --> 00:13:45.360
Was it inconvenient?

00:13:45.950 --> 00:13:47.110
Not really.

00:13:47.240 --> 00:13:52.120
What's this? Catchick is acting
very assertive today.

00:13:52.240 --> 00:13:54.790
I'm too embarrassed to watch!

00:13:58.080 --> 00:14:01.210
Did you eat something funny?

00:14:01.340 --> 00:14:03.630
Oh you tease.

00:14:03.760 --> 00:14:07.550
If you're being like that, I'll do this.

00:14:14.180 --> 00:14:15.560
What is this?

00:14:15.680 --> 00:14:16.730
Kitaro!

00:14:17.900 --> 00:14:19.730
That's the Kasha!

00:14:21.190 --> 00:14:24.190
Kitaro, I'll be taking this body!

00:14:26.570 --> 00:14:27.950
Whoa! Look out!

00:14:29.160 --> 00:14:32.950
Are you okay, Rat Man? I mean, Catchick.

00:14:33.080 --> 00:14:35.910
What is with this useless body?

00:14:45.760 --> 00:14:49.380
This is great!
I feel a thousand years younger!

00:14:49.510 --> 00:14:50.890
FUNERAL HALL

00:14:51.010 --> 00:14:52.800
Toko!

00:14:52.930 --> 00:14:54.520
Mommy!

00:15:05.360 --> 00:15:07.280
I'll be taking this!

00:15:07.400 --> 00:15:08.570
Toko!

00:15:08.700 --> 00:15:09.660
Mommy!

00:15:10.660 --> 00:15:11.910
Mommy!

00:15:13.700 --> 00:15:15.660
"Mommy",  huh?

00:15:26.710 --> 00:15:30.180
It's been a while since I've had
a spicy, fresh corpse.

00:15:30.300 --> 00:15:32.510
I'm not waiting until I get home.

00:15:33.050 --> 00:15:35.220
Kitaro, what are you doing?

00:15:35.810 --> 00:15:37.520
Uh, er, well...

00:15:37.640 --> 00:15:38.930
Mana!

00:15:39.060 --> 00:15:40.690
Watch out!

00:15:41.730 --> 00:15:43.190
That's not me!

00:15:44.060 --> 00:15:45.320
Cat-san?

00:15:45.440 --> 00:15:47.190
Mana, come here quickly!

00:15:47.320 --> 00:15:49.900
You're both acting strange.

00:15:50.320 --> 00:15:52.990
Mana, watch out! That's the Kasha!

00:15:53.120 --> 00:15:54.240
Huh?! The Kasha?

00:15:54.910 --> 00:15:56.740
No, that's the Kasha!

00:15:57.120 --> 00:15:58.750
And I'm Kitaro.

00:15:58.870 --> 00:16:00.710
I'm Catchick.

00:16:01.710 --> 00:16:05.250
What? Everything's all off.
What's going on?!

00:16:05.380 --> 00:16:08.380
Don't be fooled, Mana!
I'm the real Kitaro!

00:16:08.510 --> 00:16:10.260
Look at my eye!

00:16:11.050 --> 00:16:11.760
Oh!

00:16:12.470 --> 00:16:16.760
Then answer this. What fortune did I get
at the shrine this New Year's?

00:16:16.890 --> 00:16:18.770
-If you're really Kitaro, you'd know.
-Huh?

00:16:20.600 --> 00:16:22.020
Your fortune?

00:16:24.520 --> 00:16:28.820
<i>Fortunes at New Year's are
usually all Best Luck.</i>

00:16:28.940 --> 00:16:30.440
It was Best Luck!

00:16:33.660 --> 00:16:34.870
Kitaro.

00:16:37.660 --> 00:16:39.620
I'm sorry!

